WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
[Upbeat funky techno]

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:15.410
- [Christian Pulisic:] The game was always my dream.
To play at the highest level,

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.760
to achieve greatness.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.880
Too small. Not strong
enough. Won't make it.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.250
You have to believe in
yourself when others don't.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.530
Hard work, dedication,
and commitment

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.780
helped me to get to
this stage, to represent

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:30.670
my country at the biggest
tournament in the world.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:34.570
Qualifying for this World
Cup, that was huge for me.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.550
I've always wanted to
play in a World Cup,

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.590
and after not doing
so last time around,

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:42.100
this was the moment that,
really, I was most proud of.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.600
What this World Cup
is gonna mean

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.000
to people, what it's gonna
mean to myself and my team,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.138
which is everything.

00:00:47.138 --> 00:00:49.180
And we're gonna give
it absolutely everything.

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:51.340
I wanna be a big leader
on the national team.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.460
That's what I push for.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.480
And every time I step
out on the field,

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.290
that's what I want
my teammates to see.

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:58.054
[Dramatic electric guitar]

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:02.500
- [Mark Pulisic:] We never expected any
of this to happen

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.080
as far as the level he
is, where he is right now.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.930
But my wife and I knew
there was something

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:09.040
in him playing soccer.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.640
It was almost unbearable
to see how driven he was.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.860
- I think I've just
learned to be fearless.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:18.650
Ever since I was, you know, super young,
playing against older kids. You know,

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:21.670
my dad taught me, taught me to
never be scared of anyone.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.980
Go in, be confident, be
yourself, put in the work.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:26.630
I think you can
accomplish anything,

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:28.590
and that's the way
I've always seen it.

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:29.590
- [Kristen Dania:] You ready?

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.320
- Yeah, man.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:30.820
- Yeah?

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:31.653
- Let's do this thing.

00:01:31.653 --> 00:01:33.220
Are you ready?

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:33.720
- Always.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:38.000
[Funky mellow music]

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.420
Dude, you gotta do better than that.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:40.670
- I was goin’ for the bank shot.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:41.720
Watch. Ready?

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.900
Off the backboard.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.340
Yes.
- That's what I like to see.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:48.530
How do you keep that—
- Yeah.
- That mentality,

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:50.660
keep it through all these,
like, rough games?

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.350
- It's the competitive
spirit within me.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:53.900
I just always wanna
win, no matter

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.370
what it is that I'm doing.

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:58.400
A lot of the top athletes will
have that same drive in them.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.840
When something
that they're doing

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:01.340
isn't up to their
standards, they're

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:02.630
not gonna stop
training, not gonna

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:04.040
stop until they get
it right, and that's

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.120
how I've always been.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.940
I truly am competitive
in everything that I do,

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:11.030
whether it's this, golf,
soccer, anything in the world.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.220
- [Mark Pulisic:] Did he have a mindset of
an elite soccer player

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:14.000
from a young age?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.110
I believe he did.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:17.180
I think it's the
fearlessness to wanna be

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.770
put in uncomfortable positions.

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:20.963
And he was fearless
when he was 15 years old

00:02:20.963 --> 00:02:22.880
and he had to make a
trip to Germany. And then

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.310
on his next move, to make a
step into the Premier League,

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:27.620
he accepted that challenge.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:30.793
You know, you have to always wanna be
the best in everything you do,

00:02:30.793 --> 00:02:32.960
whether it's every training
session, whatever you're

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.180
working on, as far as
what you need in your game

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.950
and putting that extra time in.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:40.335
And he's willing to do that.

00:02:40.335 --> 00:02:41.960
- [Dania:] You started becoming
a big fan of chess,

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.970
and I know that you
stream chess.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.720
- I love chess.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.160
It started a couple
years ago.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.170
I think there is a
lot of just keeping

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:51.050
your mind sharp, and the way
that you have to think quickly.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:54.680
And I also play a lot of, like, speed
chess. Like, three-minute games.
- Right.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:57.350
- It's just, like, constantly
having to make decisions.

00:02:57.350 --> 00:02:59.600
In some ways, it
does, like, calm me down.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.500
After a tough day,
after a good day,

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.400
I can just come home
and go play some chess,

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:10.180
and it's just something
that I always enjoy doing.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.580
- [Interviewer:] What would your advice
be to a young player

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.560
here, coping with
the mental pressures?

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.500
- Make sure you're always enjoying
the game, because that's

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:20.020
been a real big one for me.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:23.050
You know, the second that you feel like
the game isn't fun anymore

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.570
and you're just playing
just to play and to please

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:29.150
other people, you're never gonna
reach the highest level.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.132
So, you need to be
yourself. Enjoy the game.

00:03:31.132 --> 00:03:33.590
Play because you love it, because
you have a passion for it,

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.382
and that's when I feel
like I'm at my best.

00:03:35.382 --> 00:03:37.770
[Dramatic instrumentals]

